* Tests: one space between the number and the letter N, S, E or W is valid. It has the same meaning as no space.

AC D
AY CTR
AN Example CTR
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 46:00:00 N 014:00:00 E
DP 46:00:00 N 014:10:00 E
DP 45:55:00N 014:10:00 E
DP 45:55:00 N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
AC D
AY CTR
AN Example circle
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
V X=46:30:00 N 014:30:00 E
DC 2.5
